WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.800
The Auditor General's report documented a procurement chain that broke every rule in the book.

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:16.550
A two-person firm known as GCStrategies received over 19 million dollars, while 76 percent of subcontractors billed performed zero work on the application.
